  "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe help text incorrectly describes PR search capabilities and omits legacy-host and `--web` limitations.\n\n*Get a fresh assessment by requesting another Copilot review.*\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** 2 <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Open (2)</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Scope guidance to backends supporting advanced issue search](#discussion_r4106126529) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Correct claim that pull-request searches support advanced syntax](#discussion_r4106126589) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds help text explaining boolean and nested query handling for search commands.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Documents query argument quoting for issue searches.\n- Documents claimed operator limitations for pull request searches.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `pkg/​cmd/​search/​issues/​issues.go` | Adds boolean-query guidance. |\r\n| `pkg/​cmd/​search/​prs/​prs.go` | Adds operator-support guidance. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 Configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
